<section class="ash-sanctuary" id="the-end" data-ash-sanctuary data-folio-outro data-motion-section aria-labelledby="ash-title">
  <header class="ash-heading">
    <div class="ash-chapter"><span><b aria-hidden="true">&gt;</b> THE LIVING ARCHIVE</span><i></i><span>04 / THE NINE WORLDS</span></div>
    <div class="ash-heading-row">
      <div><p class="ash-eyebrow">AT THE ROOTS OF THE WORLD</p><h2 id="ash-title">YGGDRASIL<span>.</span></h2></div>
      <p class="ash-intro"><span>一方遗迹，九界的回声。</span>在世界树的根系间，留一盏灯。</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="ash-exhibit" data-ash-exhibit data-exploring="false">
    <div class="ash-landscape" id="ash-model-stage" data-ash-landscape data-awake="false" data-model-state="idle" data-world-module="{{ url_for('js/sanctuary-world.js') }}?v={{ theme.asset_version }}">
      <img class="ash-model-poster" src="{{ url_for('images/yggdrasil-diorama.webp') }}?v={{ theme.asset_version }}" alt="方形遗迹底座上的世界树，九界符文石围绕树根，泉水映着暖光，断桥、石阶和乌鸦隐在寒夜中。" width="1400" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <canvas class="ash-model-canvas" data-ash-canvas tabindex="-1" role="img" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="可旋转的世界树与九界微缩景观" aria-describedby="ash-model-help ash-input-help"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="ash-controls" data-ash-controls hidden>
      <p class="ash-input-note" id="ash-input-help"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="ash-desktop-help"><b data-ash-mode-label>滚轮浏览页面</b><span data-ash-mode-help>拖动旋转 · Shift + 滚轮缩放</span></span><span class="ash-touch-help"><b>双指缩放模型</b><span>横拖旋转 · 纵滑浏览页面</span></span></p>
      <div class="ash-actions">
        <button class="ash-explore" data-ash-explore type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="ash-model-stage"><span data-ash-explore-label>探索模型</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        <div class="ash-zoom-controls" role="group" aria-label="模型视角">
          <button data-ash-action="zoom-out" type="button" aria-label="缩小模型" title="缩小模型">−</button>
          <output data-ash-zoom aria-label="模型缩放比例">100%</output>
          <button data-ash-action="zoom-in" type="button" aria-label="放大模型" title="放大模型">+</button>
          <button data-ash-action="reset" type="button" aria-label="复位模型视角" title="复位模型视角（R）">↺</button>
        </div>
        <button data-ash-action="rain" type="button" aria-pressed="true" title="切换细雨与静夜">细雨</button>
        <button data-ash-action="next" type="button" title="依次寻访九界（N）">下一界 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ash-discovery">
      <div><span data-ash-discovery-label>THE NINE WORLDS</span><strong data-ash-discovery-title>万物，于此相连。</strong></div>
      <p data-ash-discovery-body>九块符文石守着树根，一泓泉水映着长夜。</p>
      <span class="ash-discovery-count" data-ash-count hidden>寻访 0 / 9</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="sr-only" id="ash-model-help">滚轮默认滚动页面。点击探索模型后，边框亮起，模型内滚轮用于缩放；按 Esc、移出边框或点击外部退出。也可按住 Shift 配合滚轮缩放。鼠标拖拽旋转，右键拖拽平移。手机横向拖动旋转，双指缩放，纵向滑动浏览页面。键盘方向键旋转，加减键缩放，空格唤醒九界，R 键复位，N 键寻访下一界，数字一至九直达各界，W 键切换细雨，L 键切换木屋暖灯。轻触树心唤醒九界，符文石显现各界故事，泉水泛起涟漪，木屋切换暖灯。</p>
  <p class="sr-only" data-ash-status role="status" aria-live="polite">世界树的根系相连，九界静候微光。</p>
</section>
